        "rights": "Text gemeinfrei; TEI-Auszeichnung ELTeC CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/)",
        "attribution": "Möllhausen, Balduin: Die Mandanenwaise. ELTeC-deu, Release 1.0.0, DOI 10.5281/zenodo.4662482, CC BY 4.0. Textgrundlage TextGrid Repository textgrid:sf4q.0.",
        "retrieved_at": "2026-11-06T07:45:16.177Z"
